{"abstract":[{"text":"A type that provides uniformly distributed random data.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RandomNumberGenerator","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When you call methods that use random data, such as creating new random"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values or shuffling a collection, you can pass a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RandomNumberGenerator"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"type to be used as the source for randomness. When you don’t pass a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"generator, the default "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SystemRandomNumberGenerator"},{"type":"text","text":" type is used."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When providing new APIs that use randomness, provide a version that accepts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a generator conforming to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RandomNumberGenerator"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol as well as a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"version that uses the default system generator. For example, this "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Weekday"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enumeration provides static methods that return a random day of the week:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["enum Weekday: CaseIterable {","    case sunday, monday, tuesday, wednesday, thursday, friday, saturday","","    static func random<G: RandomNumberGenerator>(using generator: inout G) -> Weekday {","        return Weekday.allCases.randomElement(using: &generator)!","    }","","    static func random() -> Weekday {","        var g = SystemRandomNumberGenerator()","        return Weekday.random(using: &g)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"level":1,"text":"Conforming to the RandomNumberGenerator Protocol","anchor":"Conforming-to-the-RandomNumberGenerator-Protocol","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A custom "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RandomNumberGenerator"},{"type":"text","text":" type can have different characteristics"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"than the default ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SystemRandomNumberGenerator"},{"type":"text","text":" type. For example, a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"seedable generator can be used to generate a repeatable sequence of random"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"values for testing purposes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To make a custom type conform to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RandomNumberGenerator"},{"text":" protocol,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"implement the required "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"next()"},{"type":"text","text":" method. Each call to "},{"code":"next()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" must produce"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a uniform and independent random value.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Types that conform to ","type":"text"},{"code":"RandomNumberGenerator","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" should specifically document","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the thread safety and quality of the generator.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Random Number Generators","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/SystemRandomNumberGenerator"],"anchor":"Random-Number-Generators"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/RandomNumberGenerator"},